Fix the omitted-scene overlay frame — your IL-0076 code, found by your own showcase screenshot. The fix: frame the region to the line's full text-column width — the line fragment rect for the card line at the text block's width, not the glyph bounding rect — in both the legacy container and the PageSheet paths, in grid as well if the overlay draws there. The pill and disclosure then sit at the column's right edge like the note markers do.